cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, cite the repository and the commit used."
title: "Generalized equipartition theorem in Lean"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - given-names: Neil Yuanting
    family-names: Li
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/N-Y-L/generalized-equipartition-lean"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proof of classical canonical equipartition in arbitrary finite
  dimension, including coupled Hamiltonians, coordinate-slice regularity,
  observable and vector-field identities, and domain boundary corrections.
  Gaussian and absolute-value examples include proofs of every analytic
  hypothesis.
